      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-41881",
      ":question/problem": "A bag contains $2$ blue balls, $2$ green balls and $2$ red balls. If we draw three balls from the bag, the probability of drawing three balls of different colors is $0.15$. If we repeat this experiment $32$ times and return the balls after each drawing, how many times do we expect to get three balls of different colors? Round your answer to the nearest integer.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
